    <string name="string_0x7f130091">Mareegta aad eegeyso waxay isku dayaysaa in ay furto app dibadda ah. Ma jeclaan lahayd inaad sii wadato?</string>
    <string name="string_0x7f130092">Dib u noqo</string>
    <string name="string_0x7f130093">Sii wad</string>
    <string name="string_0x7f130094">Waxaad ka baxeysaa app-kayaga</string>
    <string name="string_0x7f130095">Tani waxa laga yaabaa inay sabab u tahay cilad farsamo oo aanu ka shaqaynayno sidii aanu u hagaajin lahayn. Isku day inaad dib u soo kiciso boggan.</string>
    <string name="string_0x7f130096">Dib u cusboonaysii</string>
    <string name="string_0x7f130097">Bogga hadda lama heli karo</string>
